TopRule = $* $GETREADY $* {intent=GETREADY._intent}{priority='HIGH'};

### When you're pushed the button on the bridge, say I'm ready. ###

GETREADY =
(
    $IMREADY {_intent = 'imReady'}
);
IMREADY =
(
    ( ?$IAMWEARE ready ) |
    ( okay $IAMWEARE ready ) |
    ( let\'s ( go | ( do it ) ) )
);

### USEFUL VOCAB ###
IAMWEARE = ( i am ) | i\'m | ( we are ) | we\'re;
